IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `il40-nouns`
IMPORT `il40-s11-entrenchment`

-- TESTS for section 11.  Hand rule: valid only if made by a Basic Law AND adopted by more than half of the members of the Knesset (the text: "ברוב של חברי הכנסת").
-- The Knesset's size is an input; 120 is the size the tests use, 121 is used to put the half-way case on an odd number.

§ `Tests: section 11`

#ASSERT `s 11 is met by a change made by` `a Basic Law` `adopted with` 61 `votes of` 120 `members of the Knesset`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 11 is met by a change made by` `a Basic Law` `adopted with` 60 `votes of` 120 `members of the Knesset`)
#ASSERT `s 11 is met by a change made by` `a Basic Law` `adopted with` 120 `votes of` 120 `members of the Knesset`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 11 is met by a change made by` `a law of the Knesset` `adopted with` 120 `votes of` 120 `members of the Knesset`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 11 is met by a change made by` `a law of the Knesset` `adopted with` 61 `votes of` 120 `members of the Knesset`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 11 is met by a change made by` `a regulation` `adopted with` 120 `votes of` 120 `members of the Knesset`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 11 is met by a change made by` `an Order in Council of the Mandate` `adopted with` 120 `votes of` 120 `members of the Knesset`)
#ASSERT `s 11 is met by a change made by` `a Basic Law` `adopted with` 61 `votes of` 121 `members of the Knesset`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 11 is met by a change made by` `a Basic Law` `adopted with` 60 `votes of` 121 `members of the Knesset`)
#ASSERT `s 11 is met by a change made by` `a Basic Law` `adopted with` 1 `votes of` 1 `members of the Knesset`
#ASSERT `s 11 entrenches section` 1 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 11 entrenches section` 11 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 11 entrenches section` 6 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 11 entrenches section` 0 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 11 entrenches section` 12 EQUALS NOTHING
